{"title":"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following numbers is closest to 10?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/7/97776914073b80bbb7fe025fdce03f4c671218b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 13 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"369\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Finding_all_Differences.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Finding_all_Differences)\">Solution 1 (Finding all Differences)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Finding all Differences)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can find the positive difference between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and each answer choice and see which difference is the smallest:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/3/eb331f5178db027d9b8a2216fd76d322088249f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|1 - 10| = |-9| = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcd230b0fc1115b38969b2883a9fb47d41e0b268.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|5 - 10| = |-5| = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/b/5bbbab6e12a9fcde9a8f96ed2e597469b6e138a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|8 - 10| = |-2| = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/1/6a126c6133106cfdda2bbd0b9d00778ed3f159f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|13 - 10| = |3| = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41e6c9beee2a5bcdb97875c66f29ddf8e13b85ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|19 - 10| = |9| = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We then see that the closest number was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/5/c75c6db723da127699234188583c193b662b8ee8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Arranging.2C_Modified_from_Official_Solution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Arranging,_Modified_from_Official_Solution)\">Solution 2 (Arranging, Modified from Official Solution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Arranging, Modified from Official Solution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Arranging the numbers from least to greatest (including <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />), we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/d/a6d9f7f778b1c6a17525f48866a089588d3e4a2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 5, 8, 10, 13, 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>We can then see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> would be the closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We then see that the closest number of the two to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/5/c75c6db723da127699234188583c193b662b8ee8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher and CEMC\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4\" t